### 🟢 SLIDE 3: Technical Architecture & System Design

**[Visual Layout]:** High-level architectural block diagram showing the 4 layers.

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   PRESENTATION & USER EXPERIENCE LAYER                 │
│   Next.js 15 (App Router) • TypeScript Strict • Tailwind CSS • Leaflet │
│   [Citizen Portal]  •  [Student Workspace]  •  [Gov Analytics Hub]    │
└───────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                                    │ (RESTful JSON APIs / JWT Auth)
┌───────────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  FASTAPI CORE MICRO-SERVICES LAYER                     │
│  • IAM & Multi-Role RBAC Service       • Challenge State Machine       │
│  • Team Formation & Recruitment        • Storage & MIME Magic Checker  │
│  • AI Classification & Similarity      • Immutable Audit Log Engine    │
└───────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                                    │ (Async Engine / SQLAlchemy)
┌───────────────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   DATA & SPATIAL PERSISTENCE LAYER                     │
│  • PostgreSQL 16 Relational Core       • PostGIS Spatial Geometry      │
│  • In-Memory / Redis Token Revocation  • S3 / Local Object Storage     │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

#### Key Architectural Highlights:
1. **Layered Monolith Architecture:** Strict separation between API Routes $\rightarrow$ Service Business Logic $\rightarrow$ Repository Layer $\rightarrow$ PostgreSQL Database.
2. **Deterministic State Machine:** 8-state challenge workflow (`draft` $\rightarrow$ `submitted` $\rightarrow$ `under_review` $\rightarrow$ `approved` $\rightarrow$ `published` $\rightarrow$ `closed` / `archived`).
3. **Concurrency & Race Safeguards:** Optimistic locking (`version` column) and row-level locks preventing capacity oversubscription.
4. **Audit & Compliance:** 100% immutable audit trails for every state change, invitation, and financial/mentor allocation.

> **🗣️ Speaking Pitch for Slide 3:**  
> *"Our architecture is built on a high-performance, asynchronous FastAPI backend and a Next.js 15 frontend. It utilizes PostgreSQL with PostGIS for spatial queries, enforces strict role-based access control across 6 stakeholder roles, and guarantees concurrency safety with optimistic locking."*

